            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Heartsong"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(emotion, enchantment, mental, occult)\n\nA creature that takes mental damage from the love siktempora's emotional bolt must succeed at a 37 Will save or become fascinated by the siktempora until the end of the target's next turn. Hostile actions don't end this fascinated condition."
